 "brief_summary": "The purpose of this study is to learn about the safety and effectiveness of berobenatide in adults with overweight or obesity who have already lost weight while taking semaglutide or tirzepatide. The study does not include people with diabetes.\n\nParticipants will be in the study for about 11 months.",
